  "label": "Textual Expression: 'dafuq else im'a do'",
  "description": "The phrase 'dafuq else im'a do' is a colloquial, informal expression using African American Vernacular English (AAVE) and internet slang. 'Dafuq' is a phonetic spelling of 'what the fuck', and 'im'a do' is a contraction of 'I'm a do'. This requires knowledge of contemporary internet slang and AAVE to fully understand the tone of exasperated resignation.",
